    "answer": {
      "short": "$f(0)=-1$, $f(1)=3$, $f(2)=5$.",
      "worked": "Since $0<1$, use the branch $x^2-1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}f(0)&=0^2-1\\\\f(0)&=-1\\end{align*}$$\n\nAt $x=1$, the middle branch gives $f(1)=3$.\n\nSince $2>1$, use the branch $2x+1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}f(2)&=2(2)+1\\\\f(2)&=5\\end{align*}$$",
